      "name": "search-algolia",
      "type": "registry:item",
      "title": "Algolia Search provider",
      "description": "Installs the Algolia InstantSearch provider adapter.",
      "docs": "Run `pnpm --filter cli cli search provision --locale en-US` and repeat --locale for the deployment languages. Set ALGOLIA_APPLICATION_ID, ALGOLIA_ADMIN_API_KEY and ALGOLIA_REGION. An omitted --index-prefix uses unprefixed names. Provisioning configures the selected CMS Content indices, locale-isolated Query Suggestions, a scoped runtime search key, and a separate Content write key. All generated Search and Content credentials use one destination: --store local writes one private --output file, while --store vercel publishes them to the linked web project as server-side configuration with sensitive keys. Use local output for manual CMS setup because sensitive keys cannot be read back from Vercel. Commerce selections additionally install Product indexing, connectors, pricing configuration and `search types generate`. CMS indexing setup is owned by the selected CMS integration.",
      "registryDependencies": [
        "jakala-na/next-hydra/search-contract",
        "search-web"
      ],
